      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the only matrix where this issue happens, right? I only did some quick checks, but it looks like any input coordinate will be transformed to a point. e.g. Try:\n\n```\n-1 -1 -1.1 -1 3 3 cm\n1 0 0 rg\n0 0 200 200 re f\n```\n\nand then decrease the matrix\u0027s c, e, and f values.\n\nOr everything gets transformed to points on a line:\n\n```\n-1 -1 -1 -1 0 0 cm\n1 0 0 rg\n-999 -999 999 999 re f\n```",
      "revId": "62e44af30829535e718a65f640564147fc199b83",
